{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Fix implemented, Gerrit change 3192 (commit c08489866b3), awaiting votes.\n\nChanges: both plan-review verifier prompts scope cited_reference_accurate to the finding's own evidence (a wrong plan citation the finding reports is yes, never no); docs/plan-review-gate.md decision-rule sentence says the veto fires on the finding's own refuted citation; new tests/external/test_cited_reference_veto_scope_live.py, parametrized over both variants, builds its own fixture repo so the cited lines never drift.\n\nLive test, production verifier model (bedrock sonnet-4-6 via a scratch REBAR_LLM_CONFIG_FILE; the external tier's default model resolves to opus-4-8):\n- unfixed prompts: agentic FAILS (0/3 runs spared both correct findings); single-turn FAILS (0/3).\n- fixed prompts: both variants PASS; agentic still vetoes the control finding whose own evidence is wrong.\n- On opus-4-8 (the tier default) the agentic arm already spared the findings on the unfixed prompt and only the single-turn arm failed (0/3), so the defect is model-dependent; it is fully present on the model the gate actually uses.\n\nThrowaway review (AC: case 2): erective-wax-nautilus carried the case-2 plan text (`CHANGELOG.md:371` for the v0.12.0 REBAR_LLM_MODEL removal). One review-plan run after the fix surfaced it as 3 BLOCKING findings (E4 fd944fe28831fe45c, G1G2 f446c6fb1321bdbe5, G6 fd9051c30b3760b92), each with cited_reference_accurate=yes and evidence_entails_finding=yes, each naming the real anchors CHANGELOG.md:569 / heading :543. The same shape was dropped under the veto on jestful-weighted-caiman before the fix. 1 live gate run on the throwaway in total; it is archived.\n\nCase mapping: case 1 (nonexistent test path) and case 4 (line points at a heading) are the fixture's two plan-citation findings; case 2 is the throwaway review; cases 3 (release-notes/CHANGELOG line ranges) and 5 (registry.py line pair) are the same shape, a finding correcting a plan's line citation with the right anchor in its evidence.\n\nChecks: make lint passes; make typecheck passes; test_criteria_vocabulary_reviewers + test_review_kernel + test_plan_review: 301 passed; every unit/interface test that references the verifier prompts or the gate doc: 1157 passed; tests that census tests/external: 364 passed.\n\nOut of scope, filed: asthmatic-bemused-wyvern (code-review verifier has the same unscoped wording; measure first)."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793508608121770001,"uuid":"d695428e-f1f1-4b2c-a56d-bad0457d2396"}